{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">特區政府與深圳當局分別在新皇崗口岸大樓，進行通關演練。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關聯同入境處、衞生署、警務處及政府產業署，約50人在港方口岸區進行跨部門演練。模擬車輛出入境時有特別狀況，包括查驗系統故障及車輛需要折返而倒車離開、「聯合一站式」車道等。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.BORDER-2300 new.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026VIeJqbt2sA1786461953.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.BORDER-2300 new.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.BORDER-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20260kFQW0bvq41786461969.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.BORDER-2300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關指演練加強各部門突發情況下的溝通及協作。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">深圳市口岸辦下午就在大樓進行電梯運行壓力測試，及旅客通關動線演練，全程約兩小時。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">兩地政府正為大樓通關進行多場測試及演練，暫時仍未敲定開通日期。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T15:39:38.070688+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}